# Metric — Layout B: wide stat bar

Horizontal strip (6x1). Number + unit inline with label, condition
chips visible, matching-count as secondary stat. For when the metric
IS the headline of the dashboard.

```
+----------------------------------------------------------+
| Pipeline value                                            |
|   $1.24M   sum(amount)        42 matching     [+8% wk]    |
|   [stage: open] [owner: any] [amount > 0]                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
```

Config: same schema as A; layout w>=6, h=1 triggers bar rendering.
One widget type, responsive variant by aspect ratio.
